      "scope_note": "With a timestamped attribute update and the TimeStamp-preferred order fixed, changing the sender from non-regulating to regulating changes sent/received order from RECEIVE/RECEIVE to TIMESTAMP/TIMESTAMP. This directly covers the sender-status factor for this attribute service; receiver status is fixed and other message families are not implied."
